# conv_ball (Track A, wave 3): data set 3 on the nested static mesh "nest64_L32" of the G2
# convergence series (tracks/A-emd-pbh/conv_ball/DESIGN.md). Written by scripts/make_decks.py.
# Root 128^3 cells of M/2 over [-32, 32]^3 in MeshBlocks of 32^3; 5 static
# levels, level l covering [-32/2^l, 32/2^l]^3; finest cells M/64 inside [-1, 1]^3
# (344 leaf MeshBlocks, 11272192 leaf cells). Physics, gauge, deposit and finder as BH-1R
# (runs_ball/bh_smr.athinput at 9cddbfc6). Give on the command line:
#   problem/comp0_file=<prep>/<stem>.tab
#   particles/particle_file=<prep>/<lattice>/<stem>_<lattice>_track.nrp   particles/traj_ntrack=<n_track>

<comment>
problem   = expanding dust ball, data set 3, relaxed 1+log lapse, nested static mesh nest64_L32

<job>
basename  = ball

<mesh>
nghost    = 4
nx1       = 128
x1min     = -32.0
x1max     = 32.0
ix1_bc    = outflow
ox1_bc    = outflow
nx2       = 128
x2min     = -32.0
x2max     = 32.0
ix2_bc    = outflow
ox2_bc    = outflow
nx3       = 128
x3min     = -32.0
x3max     = 32.0
ix3_bc    = outflow
ox3_bc    = outflow

<meshblock>
nx1       = 32
nx2       = 32
nx3       = 32

<mesh_refinement>
refinement       = static

<refined_region1>
level = 1
x1min = -15.60000
x1max = 15.60000
x2min = -15.60000
x2max = 15.60000
x3min = -15.60000
x3max = 15.60000

<refined_region2>
level = 2
x1min = -7.80000
x1max = 7.80000
x2min = -7.80000
x2max = 7.80000
x3min = -7.80000
x3max = 7.80000

<refined_region3>
level = 3
x1min = -3.90000
x1max = 3.90000
x2min = -3.90000
x2max = 3.90000
x3min = -3.90000
x3max = 3.90000

<refined_region4>
level = 4
x1min = -1.95000
x1max = 1.95000
x2min = -1.95000
x2max = 1.95000
x3min = -1.95000
x3max = 1.95000

<refined_region5>
level = 5
x1min = -0.97500
x1max = 0.97500
x2min = -0.97500
x2max = 0.97500
x3min = -0.97500
x3max = 0.97500


<time>
evolution  = dynamic
integrator = rk4
cfl_number = 0.25
nlim       = -1
tlim       = 16.0
ndiag      = 10

<z4c>
lapse_oplog     = 2.0
lapse_harmonicf = 1.0
lapse_harmonic  = 0.0
lapse_volume    = 0.0
lapse_advect    = 1.0
lapse_leak      = 8.0      # 1/T of the relaxation of the excess lapse; T = 0.125 M
lapse_leak_alpha = 1.0     # reference lapse
shift_Gamma     = 0.75
shift_eta       = 2.0
shift_advect    = 1.0
diss            = 0.5
chi_div_floor   = 1.0e-5
damp_kappa1     = 0.02
damp_kappa2     = 0.0
excise_chi      = 0.0

<fastflow>
find_every        = 32
metric_drvts      = interpolant
num_horizons      = 1
npunct            = 0
ntheta            = 16
lmax              = 8
use_puncture_0    = -1
center_x_0        = 0.0
center_y_0        = 0.0
center_z_0        = 0.0
initial_radius_0  = 1.0
flow_iterations_0 = 400
flow_alpha_beta_const_0 = 1.0
hmean_tol_0       = 100.0
mass_tol_0        = 1.0e-5
start_time_0      = 9.0
stop_time_0       = 1000.0
verbose           = false

<particles>
particle_type  = nrpic
pusher         = midpoint
metric         = mesh
interp         = bspline
tolerance      = 1.0e-10
max_iterations = 50
deposit        = true
deposit_shape  = pcs
deposit_comp_c = 0.1666666666666667
deposit_comp_c2 = 0.4666666666666667
nfilter        = 0
filter_compensate = false
source_density = true
source_extrap  = true
alpha_exc      = 0.1
hist_dcycle    = 1
cstat_dcycle   = 1
traj_dcycle    = 32
traj_ntrack    = 0
snap_dt        = 4.0
field_constraints = true
field_time1    = 4.0
field_time2    = 8.0
field_time3    = 10.0
field_time4    = 12.0
particle_file  = ball.nrp

<problem>
pgen_name  = nrpic_cf
ncomp      = 1
comp0_type = table
comp0_file = ball.tab
lapse      = table
lapse_comp = 0
shift      = zero

<output1>
file_type = hst
dt        = 0.25

<output2>
file_type = rst
dt        = 4.0

<output3>
file_type = tab
variable  = adm
dt        = 0.25
slice_x2  = 0.01
slice_x3  = 0.01
data_format = %.12e

<output4>
file_type = tab
variable  = z4c
dt        = 0.25
slice_x2  = 0.01
slice_x3  = 0.01
data_format = %.12e

<output5>
file_type = tab
variable  = con
dt        = 0.25
slice_x2  = 0.01
slice_x3  = 0.01
data_format = %.12e

<output6>
file_type = tab
variable  = tmunu
dt        = 0.25
slice_x2  = 0.01
slice_x3  = 0.01
data_format = %.12e
